    "task_id": "2026-08-26-002-imm-storage-layout-cutover",
    "goal": "Ship the Immune-Brain storage-layout cutover release: make ignored `.imm/state/` the sole mutable Kernel authority store, make tracked per-task `.imm/audit/` the sole terminal evidence store, transfer terminal ownership through one recoverable exact-replay settlement transaction, add a one-release automatic claimless legacy-layout migrator shared by stateful CLI and Pi entrypoints that performs no Git index writes and stops the triggering operation until its diff is committed, preserve explicit historical v3 audit without authority, and delete retired project-local template, MEMORY, active-v2 compatibility, and current contract surfaces while retaining an explicit immediate-successor deletion boundary for the migrator.",
