        "assertion": "Every stateful `imm-kernel` and native Pi entrypoint uses one layout inspection contract: status, audit, validation, and preparation remain zero-write and report migration/recovery requirements without interpreting old authority, while explicit mutation performs eligible migration or recovery and returns before TaskIntent authoring or Enrollment authority commit.",
