      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/storage_layout_migration.ts: convergeRelocation returns when matching source and target both exist instead of deleting the verified source, so an interruption after target creation leaves duplicate legacy authority and recovery falsely removes the marker; verify replay removes the source and retains the exact target bytes."
    },
    {
