      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-automatic-layout-migration",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/storage_layout_migration.ts: migration leaves emptied .imm/tasks, .imm/memory, and .imm/templates directories, while inspectOldLayout treats those directories as legacy authority, so a completed migration never reaches ready; verify migrated repositories remove empty legacy directories and inspect as migration_uncommitted then ready after commit."
    },
    {
      "id": "review-5e786200bb1b-3-review-3",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-automatic-layout-migration",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/storage_layout_migration.ts: readPendingMigrationMarker does not validate source/target containment, target and size types, allowed path mappings, or symlinked parent segments before resolve/read/delete, allowing a crafted recovery marker to access or delete paths outside the repository; verify escaped, malformed, and symlink-parent entries fail before any relocation."
    },
